<title>JAPAN: Dec JGB futures close at record high of 125.19.</title>
<headline>Dec JGB futures close at record high of 125.19.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The key December Japanese government bond (JGB) futures contract surged on Wednesday to close at 125.19, the highest level ever for any benchmark contract listed on the Tokyo Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>It ended at 124.50 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>---Tokyo Treasury Desk 813-3432-8676</p>
</text>
